.DS_Store
*.log
__pycache__/
.codex-marketplace-install.json
.claude/

# The user's global excludes (~/.config/git/ignore) drop SUMMARY.md and HANDOFF.md.
# Untracked means git cannot restore them, which also makes them undeliverable by the
# agent-advisor sync (its Guard 5 refuses to let rsync touch an unrecoverable file).
!SUMMARY.md
!HANDOFF.md
